	<ehr:termdefinition.dp.language>en</ehr:termdefinition.dp.language>
	<ehr:termdefinition.dp.text>Problem</ehr:termdefinition.dp.text>
	<ehr:termdefinition.dp.description>An issue or obstacle which adversely impacts on the physical, mental and/or social well-being of an individual. The definition of a problem is deliberately kept rather loose so as to capture any real or perceived concerns that may adversely affect an individual's wellbeing to any degree.  </ehr:termdefinition.dp.description>
</rdf:Description>

